      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Industry Taxonomy Versions provides industry data across the LinkedIn platform.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API provides versioned industry data with hierarchical parent/child relationships. The parentIndustries field contains URNs of parent industry categories, and childrenIndustries contains URNs of child industries. Root industries have empty parentIndustries; leaf industries have empty childrenIndustries.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API may also be referred to as \u0022Industry Classification\u0022 in other contexts. Use version DEFAULT to access the latest industry taxonomy.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Industry Taxonomy Versions",
      "Anchor": "industry-taxonomy-versions",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get an industry entity by its ID.\nBatch get industry entities for the set of industry IDs.\nGet all industry entities.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Retrieve Industry IDs",
      "Anchor": "how-to-retrieve-industry-ids",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Retrieve Industry IDs"
      ],
      "Text": "Use GET_ALL with pagination to list all industries. Industry IDs also appear in responses from other DMA APIs such as Organizations. Use parent/child URNs to navigate the industry hierarchy.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
